# Generated Prisma Client. `src/generated/prisma/` is fully generated by
# `npx prisma generate` and must stay out of git. `src/generated/tsconfig.json`
# is a tracked placeholder (NOT ignored) that stops `prisma generate`'s
# tsconfig lookup before it reaches the SvelteKit root tsconfig.json, which
# it cannot parse. See the "Prisma generate + tsconfig" note in README.md.
/src/generated/prisma/

